A||||28||MinnGreenGT||Minn Night Out Pics (Bandwidth Friendly)||||6||
Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||10-01-2001||01:26 PM||||We gathered 11 Fieros & 2 Barettas (Jai Sun... next time we'll see your blue GT) in the North lot at the MOA on Saturday night.  We stood in the cold (Yes, after the sun went down it got REALLY COLD) for about 1 1/2 hours talking and checking out everybody's mods.  Then 7 cars (sorry I don't remember everyone's names) caravaned up to University Ave- where we ate at Perkins, still telling stories (Fiero people can talk all night long you know).  After our late dinner we headed down to the local ricer hangout, only to find it totally deserted (must've been too close to curfew)  We then headed back up University to Porkey's where they turned the lights out on use about 5 minutes after we got there- we stayed about a half hour anyway.  Tina's car gathered quite a crowd.  After leaving Porkey's (not quitely either) we continued down to "Red Rock" where we filled the corner of the lot with Fieros.  Again, Tina's car gathered quite a crowd (hmmm... wonder why). We were going to head down to the strip, but found that the cops had shut it down for the night already.  That ended the night around 12:30am when most of us headed home!<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_01c.jpg">   <BR>My (MinnGreenGT) engine compartment.<BR>Notice no carpet or gasket- Any donors out there?<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_02.jpg">   <BR>lowfieroGT's ride... back after it's minor fire.<BR>notice the neon glow?<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_03.jpg">   <BR>Gary's (don't know your PFF name) Custom GT.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_04.jpg">   <BR>A few of the cars at Perkins<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fullstaff.gif">      <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 10-01-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||10-01-2001||01:27 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_05.jpg"> <BR>86seyellow's ride... ate a Neon the night before.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_06.jpg"> <BR>Standard's Quad-4... slick as always.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_07.jpg"> <BR>Tina's V8 Coupe- crowd pleaser.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_08.jpg"> <BR>Kev's 3800 85 GT<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_09.jpg"> <BR>lowfieroGT's ride again (better shot)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_10.jpg"> <BR>Tina's V8 Coupe Engine at Porkey's<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_11.jpg"> <BR>Tina's V8 Coupe at Porkey's<BR>(a little photoshop work to see the background)<P>Anyone else take any pics?||||reg||1
