Z||000005||MinnGreenGT||10-01-2001||02:11 PM||||Gary didn't do anything special to his taillights... just pulled them apart and cleaned the lens, removed the colored inserts, and stuck in colored-glass bulbs (don't use coated bulbs- they don't last). They look OK, but I've always felt that they appear kind of "unfinished."  <P>Check this link for my current Clear GT taillight project: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010073.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010073.html</A> ||||reg||1
