Z||000026||Tina||10-02-2001||11:46 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Uaana:<BR><B>I'd say I hate you all....<BR>But, oh well one of these days.</B>[/QUOTE}<BR>Ohh.....Robert, remember those two huge tires stacked on top of each other, with the pallet on wheels underneath? <BR>.....Well it's sitting directly below your Fiero.<BR>There,...hope that makes you feel a little bit better.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>On a sidenote...<BR>Came pretty close to losing my V-8 today, thanks to a faulty radiator cap and a reservoir not up to snuff.<BR>The sound and look of the antifreeze going into the engine, as we are filling it back up,and then almost instantly spewing back out and turning into steam. <BR>Somebody is going to have a nightmare tonight, I believe...<BR>Even though the compression check came back o.k., and temp stayed in the normal range on the way home.<P>Waiting to exhale<BR>Tina||||reg||1
